      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-8 mb-3">3. Community Link Portals</h3>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Interactive sports communities share live match streams during kickoff. While highly active, navigating these message boards can be tedious and exposes users to slow loading speeds.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Why Soccer100 Remains the Leader</h2>
