        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 font-medium">
          <li><strong>Script-Checked Links:</strong> Feeds are constantly tested for uptime</li>
          <li><strong>Responsive Architecture:</strong> A mobile-first design that scales perfectly</li>
          <li><strong>Clean UI:</strong> Less visual clutter than standard streaming portals</li>
